on 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gsgXQHjPHvsDsFpLGLlEvPLYIVo.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2023-04-17\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"I Like Big Boats\",\"overview\":\"Jessica went cruising for love and fell for bartender Juan. Scott is over the player life and thinks he's found the one in Pedro's mom, Lidia. VaLentine and Carlos are getting married, but Carlos' feelings for another could derail their plans.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eErUlbaHbUzgTm6K4rAGQPqyFsj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-17\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Rump Shaker\",\"overview\":\"VaLentine lands in Colombia, but Carlos worries about working out their issues before they get married. Jordan wants to commit to Everton, but she has a secret. After not being intimate with anyone for 12 years, Lidia prepares to meet Scott in person.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a914Qnlc3a6jVi4OHXM4qPTNYCc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-24\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Baby One More Time\",\"overview\":\"Juan gets a crash course in parenting Jessica's sons. April tells her sisters about her secret lover. Jordan and Everton's sweet Jamaican reunion turns unexpectedly sour. Even salsa dancing can't help the language barrier between Scott and Lidia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mbYrwlVSIpo92z7bpskF9EQYgia.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-01\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"No Scrubs\",\"overview\":\"Lidia's daughter, Nicole, grills Scott on his relationship past. Jessica worries Juan cheated while working on the cruise. April's cleanliness kicks in when she arrives in the Dominican Republic. VaLentine and Carlos cuddle after a passion-filled evening.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lCdEBcZ2ug3jif7AzNqsY2KTQBr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-08\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Hey Jealousy\",\"overview\":\"Jordan confronts Everton with the voicemail that could derail their trip. Matthew hopes he can keep up with fiancée Ana at Carnival. Jessica wants Juan to give up cruise life. Carlos storms off after a disagreement with VaL, days before their wedding.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/osz3yIrmLeD1Uv2GcFHl5d67uhV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-15\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Little Miss Can't be Wrong\",\"overview\":\"April meets Valentin's family and tensions brew about the future of their relationship. Scott and Lidia struggle to get past the language barrier. VaLentine and Carlos reach the end of their ropes about Michelle. Matthew and Ana party at Carnival.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8hsWQ8wOhH3a27b9orGNneNNrpi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-22\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Cry Me A River\",\"overview\":\"Juan and Jessica give the boys an unwelcome surprise. Scott decides his relationship with Lidia has insurmountable challenges. Jordan comes clean to Everton about her videos. Matthew gets jealous when guys hit on Ana at Carnival.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e3lVAHDT040d6fYGMO8hVdLc6r7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-29\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Mama Said Knock You Out\",\"overview\":\"April offends Valentin at a family party. Scott faces the wrath of Lidia's daughter, Nicole. VaLentine and Carlos struggle with their emotions post-breakup. Jessica's friend Megin confronts Juan about cheating.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eSyIg1bCzmAugViRr670o3nqDiI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-05\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Just A Friend\",\"overview\":\"Jessica worries Juan will cheat when he goes back on the cruise. Carlos tells Michele she was the reason he and VaLentine canceled the wedding. Ana learns the visa will take longer than expected. Everton embarrasses Jordan in front of his family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4BBEJ7C2QzKJuDqb2O3a4sBoZY8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-12\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Mo Money Mo Problems\",\"overview\":\"Jessica anxiously says goodbye to Juan as he heads back to cruise life; Matthew and Ana worry their relationship won't last; April tracks down Valentin when he goes MIA for days; after ending things with Lidia, Scott has a surprise meet-up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1k4qE22ZUllAczevE3Va0ng1RYz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-19\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"I Saw the Sign\",\"overview\":\"Matthew and Ana have a tearful goodbye. After calling off their wedding, VaLentine and Carlos reunite. Scott overwhelms his ex Lis with his love. Jordan finds out how Everton has been spending the money she sent him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fZNKnpc7eSL5Ob3RmxgooqoOAEH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-26\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Night Swimming\",\"overview\":\"April and Valentin decide the fate of their relationship. Jordan says goodbye to Everton and leaves Jamaica. After disagreeing on parenting styles, Jessica and Juan find out the gender of their baby. Scott reaches out to Lidia for a second chance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VuhKLUZ7iRwqMTbRu0Yamk76t1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-03\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2021-07-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}